{"text": "Later, he met the Kolokolo Bird sitting in a thorn bush. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Nobody will answer me, he said, but I still want to know. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Kolokolo Bird said, Go to the great grey green, greasy Limpopo River. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Fever trees grow all along its banks, Go and find out. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The very next morning, he packed a hundred pounds of bananas. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He also took a hundred pounds of sugar cane and seventeen melons. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Goodbye, he said to his family, I am going to the Limpopo River. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He traveled for many days, eating melons all the time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At last he reached the great river. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There he met the Bi Coloured Python Rock Snake, curled around a rock. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Excuse me, have you seen a Crocodile around here, he asked politely.", "alignment": {"characters": ["L", "a", "t", "e", "r", ",", " ", "h", "e", " ", "m", "e", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "K", "o", "l", "o", "k", "o", "l", "o", " ", "B", "i", "r", "d", " ", "s", "i", "t", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "i", "n", " ", "a", " ", "t", "h", "o", "r", "n", " ", "b", "u", "s", "h", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "N", "o", "b", "o", "d", "y", " ", "w", "i", "l", "l", " ", "a", "n", "s", "w", "e", "r", " ", "m", "e", ",", " ", "h", "e", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", ",", " ", "b", "u", "t", " ", "I", " ", "s", "t", "i", "l", "l", " ", "w", "a", "n", "t", " ", "t", "o", " ", "k", "n", "o", "w", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "K", "o", "l", "o", "k", "o", "l", "o", " ", "B", "i", "r", "d", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", ",", " ", "G", "o", " ", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "g", "r", "e", "a", "t", " ", "g", "r", "e", "y", " ", "g", "r", "e", "e", "n", ","